{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109517","id":2734213124,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6i-MgE","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109517","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109517.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109517.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109517","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109517/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/109517/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109517/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/abfc63b48351b6f8abbdcecca56003f3c06071e3","number":109517,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Speed up signal disconnects in the editor","user":{"login":"precup","id":709680,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwOTY4MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/709680?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup","html_url":"https://github.com/precup","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"In editor builds only, disconnecting signals is O(n) where n is the number of connections to that signal. The O(n) operation can easily be made O(1) by filtering by the relevant signal and connection. \r\n\r\nThis is a problem in particular for large numbers of sibling `Controls`, as they all register `item_rect_changed` with their parent node. To see the problem in the test project:\r\n1. Open `MeshInstance.tscn`\r\n2. Open `Label25k.tscn`\r\n3. Attempt to switch back to the `MeshInstance` tab by clicking on it\r\n\r\nWithout the PR, step 3 hangs the editor for about ~23 seconds on my machine. With the PR, it takes a fraction of a second.\r\n\r\nWhen attempting to switch scenes, the way it frees the nodes causes all the disconnections to happen in sequence, which ends up being O(n^2) on 25,000 nodes. \r\n\r\nThe `get_persistent_signal_connection_count` function is currently only used in editor code, isn't exposed to GDScript, and the new definition is backwards compatible with the old one, so I hope it's okay to change.\r\n\r\nHere's a flamegraph of the problem occuring during the repro steps:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"3417\" height=\"1255\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/41f533b3-5dc2-493a-8b37-1109f07a8e9e\" />\r\n\r\n---------------------\r\n\r\nAll performance tests were run on builds made with the following command: `scons optimize=speed_trace debug_symbols=yes platform=linuxbsd dev_build=no production=yes`.\r\n\r\nThe test project [editor-optimization-test-scenes.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21709465/editor-optimization-test-scenes.zip) consists of a series of scenes that each have 25,000 of a common type of node.\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","number":23,"state":"closed","title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2978,"created_at":"2025-05-22T16:25:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T16:23:23Z","closed_at":"2026-01-26T18:09:14Z","due_on":null},"active_lock_reason":null,"created_a